[E] statistics projection (sigma ~ 1/sqrt(n)): to decide rho^2 <= 4 you need
    |rho^2-4| >> sigma(stat) AND spread(scheme) << 1.  Statistics shrink the bars
    around each scheme; they cannot shrink the spread between schemes.

